| F8 | David vs Goliath ELO Scoring Multiplier | Asymmetric ELO formula weighting parameter frugality, memory footprint, token efficiency, and task complexity | M4 | ORIGINAL_REQUEST §R4 |
| F9 | Economic Realignment Penalty (Waste Tax) | Severe ELO penalty calculation ($\text{Tax}_{\text{waste}}$) for unoptimized API/compute expenditure, scaling with mesh impact | M4 | ORIGINAL_REQUEST §R5 |
| F10 | Autonomous HF Hub Discovery & Download | Secure HF Hub token authentication, sub-1B GGUF model discovery, SHA-256 chunked streaming download to tmpfs/USB | M5 | ORIGINAL_REQUEST §R6 |
| F11 | Zero-Downtime Atomic Model Hot-Swap | In-process proxy request queueing, rapid model swap, and cache re-initialization maintaining peak RAM $\le 216\text{MB}$ | M5 | ORIGINAL_REQUEST §R6 |
| F12 | Decentralized Asset Packaging (5 Classes) | Standardized packaging of code components, CLI tools, MCP servers, SDK packages, and surplus compute into signed JSON payloads | M6 | ORIGINAL_REQUEST §R7 |
| F13 | Business Swarm Transmission Interface | Secure dispatch of packaged assets to Business Orchestrator / Self-Healing Hub (Port 18802) & Cloudflare Edge endpoints | M6 | ORIGINAL_REQUEST §R7 |
| F14 | Comprehensive 4-Tier E2E Test Suite | 4-tier requirement-driven opaque-box test suite validating AC-1 to AC-5, RAM bounds, debate convergence, and waste tax | M7 / E2E Track | ORIGINAL_REQUEST Acceptance Criteria |
| F15 | Adversarial Coverage Hardening (Tier 5) | White-box stress-testing, mutation testing, and adversarial edge case coverage hardening | M7 | Project Orchestration Policy |

