## Interface Contracts

### 1. Dual-Core Router ↔ Micro-Debate Engine
- **Function**: `evaluate_routing_intent(context: RoutingContext) -> ConsensusResult`
- **Payload**: `RoutingContext { intent: str, candidate_routes: List[Route], mesh_metrics: Dict, timestamp: float }`
- **Output**: `ConsensusResult { consensus_route: Route, agreed: bool, debate_rounds: int, consensus_score: float, execution_time_ms: float }`
- **SLA**: Concord fast-path $< 3.5\text{ms}$; Debate $< 45\text{ms}$.

### 2. Shadow Swarm Controller ↔ Capacity Governor
- **Function**: `scale_swarm(target_workers: int, filter_specialty: Optional[str]) -> SwarmScaleResult`
- **Input**: `RAM_budget_mb: float = 300.0`, `mesh_vram_matrix: Dict[str, float]`
- **Output**: `SwarmScaleResult { local_workers_spawned: int, mesh_workers_spawned: int, total_ram_mb: float, active_workers: List[WorkerSpec] }`

### 3. ELO & Waste Tax Engine ↔ Competitor Matchmaker
- **Function**: `record_code_off_result(match: CodeOffMatch) -> EloUpdateResult`
- **Input**: `CodeOffMatch { task_id: str, david_model: str, goliath_model: str, task_difficulty: float, david_solved: bool, goliath_solved: bool, david_resources: ResourceUsage, goliath_resources: ResourceUsage }`
- **Output**: `EloUpdateResult { delta_elo_david: float, delta_elo_goliath: float, waste_tax_applied: float, new_elo_david: float, new_elo_goliath: float }`

### 4. HF Model Manager ↔ llama.cpp Runner
- **Function**: `hot_swap_model(repo_id: str, filename: str, ram_budget_mb: float) -> ModelSwapResult`
- **Behavior**: Stream download to `/tmp/models/` -> SHA-256 verify -> Pause proxy ingestion -> Signal llama-server reload -> Resume proxy -> Verify RSS $\le 300\text{MB}$.

### 5. Business Swarm Packager ↔ Business Orchestrator
- **Function**: `package_and_transmit_asset(asset: DiscoveredAsset, target_endpoint: str) -> MonetizationReceipt`
- **Payload**: Strict JSON Schema conforming to 5 asset classes (`code_component`, `cli_tool`, `mcp_server`, `sdk_package`, `surplus_compute`), with SHA-256 hash and dynamic reserve price.

## Code Layout
```
00_core_infrastructure/router_ai_daemon/
├── Dockerfile                          # Multi-stage Alpine/musl ARM64 router container
├── Dockerfile.mips                     # MIPS OpenWrt cross-target container manifest
├── docker-compose.router.yml           # OpenWrt Compose spec with memory limits & tmpfs
├── entrypoint.sh                       # Minimal POSIX init script with cgroups enforcement
├── pyproject.toml / requirements.txt   # Lightweight Python deps (standard library first)
├── bin/
│   └── smolctl                         # POSIX executable CLI for router AI swarm management
├── src/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── config.py                       # Global router configs (RAM budget 300MB, tmpfs paths)
│   ├── container/                      # Containerization & llama-server runners
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── llama_runner.py             # Static llama-server lifecycle & memory governor
│   │   └── memory_guard.py             # cgroups /proc/self/statm RSS enforcement (<300MB)
│   ├── consensus/                      # Dual-Core Genetic Consensus & Micro-Debate
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── dual_core_router.py         # smolagi + Genetic Router coordinator
│   │   ├── genetic_router.py           # Chromosome-based network & mesh route selector
│   │   └── micro_debate.py             # 3-round micro-debate resolution protocol
│   ├── swarm/                          # Hyper-Speed Shadow Swarm Orchestration
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── swarm_controller.py         # Dynamic specialist spawner & lifecycle
│   │   ├── specialist_registry.py      # Micro-specialist architectures & quantizations
│   │   └── capacity_governor.py        # RAM/VRAM capacity scaling governor
│   ├── elo/                            # David vs Goliath ELO & Waste Tax
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── elo_engine.py               # Asymmetric efficiency-weighted ELO calculator
│   │   ├── waste_tax.py                # Economic Realignment Penalty computation
│   │   └── ledger.py                   # Atomic JSONL transaction & score ledger
│   ├── model_routing/                  # Autonomous HuggingFace GGUF Routing
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── hf_discovery.py             # HuggingFace Hub GGUF discovery & auth
│   │   ├── downloader.py               # SHA-256 verified streaming tmpfs downloader
│   │   └── hot_swap_proxy.py           # In-process request queueing & atomic model swap
│   └── monetization/                   # Business AI Swarm Interface
│       ├── __init__.py
│       ├── asset_packager.py           # 5-class asset packaging & schema validation
│       ├── business_client.py          # Port 18802 & Cloudflare edge transmission
│       └── compute_broker.py           # Surplus mesh NPU/RAM cycle packaging
└── tests/
    ├── conftest.py                     # Shared test fixtures & mock environment
    ├── test_tier1_features.py          # Tier 1: Feature Coverage (>=5 tests per feature)
    ├── test_tier2_boundaries.py        # Tier 2: Boundary & Corner Cases (<=300MB RAM, timeout, etc.)
    ├── test_tier3_combinations.py      # Tier 3: Cross-Feature Pairwise Combinations
    ├── test_tier4_real_world.py        # Tier 4: Real-World Application Workloads
    └── test_acceptance_criteria.py     # AC-1 through AC-5 Acceptance Verification
```
